  {
    "name": "Sponsor",
    "description": "One organization supporting Harvard Alumni in Tech, shown on the /sponsor wall. Stored as a markdown file in the `sponsors` content collection. `tier` groups the wall by partnership level and must match a level id in `sponsorPage.json` \u2014 an unmatched tier is reported rather than silently dropping the sponsor. `placeholder: true` marks an ILLUSTRATIVE entry: the wall then renders an explicit 'example, not actual sponsors' notice, so a page seeded with sample logos can never be mistaken for a live sponsor list. Real sponsors omit the flag. The collection starts empty in production, where the wall renders nothing at all.",
